[quote]
v1.1.0

[h1]MULTIPLAYER UPDATE[/h1]
[/quote]

[h3]Added:[/h3]
[list]
[*]Multiplayer support: ride horses with your friends!
[*]Magazine to teach some equipment recipes (saddles, saddlebags, reins)
[*]Ability to attach a lantern on your horse to light your way through the night (works in MP!)
[/list]

[h3]Added 6 new horse breeds/coat combination:[/h3]
[list]
[*]American Quarter Strawberry Roan
[*]Thoroughbred Cricket (in memory to Cricket, the horse of sewerrabbit)
[*]Thoroughbred Reverse Brindle Bay
[*]Mustang Buckskin Dun
[*]Mustang Grulla Dun
[*]Camarillo White
[/list]

[h3]Fixed:[/h3]
[list]
[*]Dismounting next to water tiles placing the player in the water and left stuck. ([url=https://github.com/PZ-HorseTeam/HorseMod/issues/387]#387[/url])
[*]Fixed inconsistent sound files naming ([url=https://github.com/PZ-HorseTeam/HorseMod/issues/199]#199[/url])
[/list]
